These two peaks are produced at time t_{\\rm I}\\simeq\\delta t and t_{\\rm II}\\simeq\\delta t+\\Delta T respectively. Substituting into Eq.(16) and combining Eq.(3)(8)(15), we can obtain n_{0}, n_{1} as

